D</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Oxidant stress in nephrotic syndrome: comparison of F(2)-isoprostanes and plasma antioxidant potential. </article-title><source>Nephrol. Dial. Transplant</source><volume>16</volume><fpage>1626</fpage><lpage>30</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11477165</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b12-bmi-03-419"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Esterbauer</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Cheeseman</surname><given-names>KH</given-names></name><name><surname>Dianzani</surname><given-names>MU</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1982</year><article-title>Separation and characterization of the aldehydic products of lipid peroxidation stimulated by ADP-Fe2+ in rat liver microsomes. </article-title><source>J. Biochem</source><volume>208</volume><fpage>129</fpage><lpage>40</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b13-bmi-03-419"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Esterbauer</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Schaur</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Zollner</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><year>1991</year><article-title>Chemistry and biochemistry of 4-hydroxynonenal, malonaldehyde and related aldehydes. </article-title><source>Free Radic. Biol. Med</source><volume>11</volume><fpage>81</fpage><lpage>128</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1937131</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b14-bmi-03-419"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ferraro</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Galli</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Frei</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Peroxynitrite-induced oxidation of plasma